{"id":"faculty-deepika_gupta:e0012","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Dr. Deepika Gupta is an Assistant Professor in Electronics and Communication Engineering discipline. Prior to joining IIITNR, she has worked as an Assistant Professor (under Technical Education Quality Improvement Program III of Govt. of India) at Veer Surendra Sai University of Technology Burla, Odisha and Rajasthan Technical University Kota, Rajasthan. Dr. Gupta has received her B.E. degree in Electronics and Communication Engineering from University of Rajasthan, M.Tech in VLSI Design from NIT Jalandhar and Ph.D. degree in Electrical Engineering from IIT Indore. She received the institute “Gold Medal” from NIT Jalandhar and \"Gargi award\" from Govt. of Rajasthan for meritorious academic performance. she has published several research papers in journals and conference proceedings of international repute.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
